<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-EVM SHARES TO BE TRADED UNDER SAME NAME.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-EVM SHARES TO BE TRADED UNDER SAME NAME.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMV construction company, which is listed on the free market, will have all of its shares traded under the same name from June 3, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Companies' Register registered the construction company's share capital increase to 47.4 million kroons on May 29, the bourse added in a statement.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
